Your mastery of arcane flows allow you to reset the cooldown of up to [2, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] of your spells (that don't have a fixed cooldown) of tier [1, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] or less.

In addition for [2, 3, 4, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns you are overflowing with energy; all known spells are considered one talent level higher when casting them.
